//
// Embeds OibToastHelper.ico as this executable's icon. This is what gives the AUMID-driven
// toast, Explorer, and the Start Menu shortcut Product.wxs creates for this exe (in this repo's
// setup/ and the sibling Pro/Subscription repos' licensing/**/setup/) a real application icon
// instead of a generic one — WiX's <Shortcut> element uses its target file's own icon when no
// explicit Icon override is given, so embedding it here is sufficient; no separate WiX <Icon>
// element is needed for the shortcut.
//
// See toastsetup.cpp's GetToastIconPath()/RegisterAumid() for the separate, loose copy of this
// same file (staged as OibToastHelper.ico next to the exe) used for the AUMID's IconUri
// registry value — that value must be a direct file path, not an embedded exe resource.

101 ICON "OibToastHelper.ico"
